# Always push to GitHub

After finishing work in this repo, commit the relevant source changes and immediately push to `origin` on the current branch.

- Do this without waiting to be asked again.
- Never commit or push `node_modules/`, `.venv/`, `.env`, secrets, or generated model/output files.
- Use `git push -u origin HEAD` when the branch has no upstream yet.
- Do not force-push to `main` or `master`.
